---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <SiteHeader current="home" />

  <main>
    <section class="border-b border-readto-rule">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-content gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[0.92fr_1.08fr] lg:items-center">
        <div class="max-w-[620px]">
          <p class="mb-7 text-[13px] leading-6 text-readto-muted" data-i18n="home.badge">Chrome 扩展 · 为真实英文网页加中文小注</p>
          <h1 class="font-serif text-[44px] font-normal leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.035em] text-readto-fg sm:text-[72px]" data-i18n-html="home.heroTitle">读英文，<br />不用频繁查词。</h1>
          <p class="mt-7 max-w-[560px] text-[16px] leading-[1.85] text-readto-fg-2 sm:text-[18px]">
            <span data-i18n="home.heroBody">readto 会根据你的英语水平，在英文网页的生词上方悄悄标好中文释义。中文小注像书页边注一样出现，不划词、不跳窗、不中断阅读。</span>
          </p>
          <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a
              href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/readto/icijjidbmcgedpiljpknpjomjjijacjp"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-readto-fg px-5 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-readto-bg transition hover:bg-readto-accent"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              <span data-i18n="home.ctaPrimary">添加到 Chrome</span>
            </a>
            <a href="#preview" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-readto-rule px-5 py-3 text-[15px] text-readto-fg transition hover:border-readto-fg">
              <span data-i18n="home.ctaSecondary">先看一段真实阅读</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="preview" class="rounded-[14px] border border-readto-rule bg-readto-card p-5 sm:p-7">
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-readto-rule pb-4 text-[12px] text-readto-muted">
            <span>readto enabled</span>
            <span data-i18n="home.previewHint">悬停单词</span>
          </div>
          <article class="font-serif text-[18px] leading-[2.25] text-readto-fg sm:text-[21px]">
            <p class="mb-5 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-readto-muted">The Atlantic · Culture</p>
            <h2 class="mb-5 text-[30px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[36px]">A city learns to listen again</h2>
            <p>
              The mayor announced <span data-readto data-word="sweeping">sweeping<span class="rt">全面的</span></span> reforms after a week of <span data-readto data-word="tense">tense<span class="rt">紧张的</span></span> negotiations, but residents remained <span data-readto data-word="skeptical">skeptical<span class="rt">怀疑的</span></span> of another <span data-readto data-word="perfunctory">perfunctory<span class="rt">敷衍的</span></span> promise.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-18">
      <div class="grid gap-8 border-b border-readto-rule pb-14 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[24px] font-normal text-readto-fg"><span data-i18n="home.how1Title">先判断你的水平</span></h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-readto-fg-2"><span data-i18n="home.how1Body">选择入门、基础、进阶、熟练或精通，readto 会把这个水平当作“已掌握词汇”的边界。</span></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[24px] font-normal text-readto-fg"><span data-i18n="home.how2Title">只给超纲词加注</span></h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-readto-fg-2"><span data-i18n="home.how2Body">常见词保持原样，真正可能打断理解的词，才在上方出现一条短中文释义。</span></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[24px] font-normal text-readto-fg"><span data-i18n="home.how3Title">留在原网页阅读</span></h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.8] text-readto-fg-2"><span data-i18n="home.how3Body">新闻、博客、文档、论文都在原页面完成阅读，不跳到另一个学习工具里。</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-14">
        <p class="max-w-[760px] font-serif text-[30px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.028em] text-readto-fg sm:text-[42px]">
          <span data-i18n="home.fitQuote">背单词的最好方式，是在真实阅读里反复遇到它。</span>
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/readto/icijjidbmcgedpiljpknpjomjjijacjp"
          class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-full border border-readto-fg px-5 py-3 text-[15px] text-readto-fg transition hover:bg-readto-fg hover:text-readto-bg"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <span data-i18n="home.ctaPrimary">添加到 Chrome</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
